The benefits of using LSTM and CNN neural networks in NLP include:
1. Improved coherence: LSTM networks can generate text that is more coherent and follows a logical sequence of events.
2. Better ethicality: By training the neural network on ethical and unbiased text data, the generated text can be more ethical and unbiased.
3. Better accuracy: CNN networks can classify text with high accuracy and can be used for tasks such as sentiment analysis and text classification.
The drawbacks of using LSTM and CNN neural networks in NLP include:
1. Complexity: Building and training deep neural networks can be complex and time-consuming.
2. Overfitting: If the model is overfit to the training data, it may not generalize well to new data.
