How can I extract specific words from a given input text using natural language processing in Swift? Can you provide a Swift code solution? Here is an example Swift code solution using NLP techniques: 
let inputText = "I want to buy a red sweater and a blue hat"
let tagger = NSLinguisticTagger(tagSchemes: [.nameType], options: 0)
